OL,3,APolanski says he will not overturn
OL,4,AGreen Party's 'Zionism is racism'
OL,5,Amotion
OL,6,
OL,7,FZack Polanski has said he will not
OL,8,Foverturn a motion passed by Green Party
OL,9,Fmembers that declared Zionism to be
OL,10,Fracist.
OL,12,FThe party leader told the Laura
OL,13,FKuenssberg on Sunday programme that,
OL,14,Fwhile he would like to amend it, the
OL,15,Fmotion would be party policy until 2028
OL,16,Fand denied it was controversial.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
